   `bench/acceptance`'s R22 checks against it — `--posture account`
   composes correctly now (ticket 0637 fixed the podman-unshare ordering).
   Commit the artifact under `bench/results/` in the same
   ungraded-diagnostic-until-upstream-merges shape 0629/0630 already used
