4. Draft (do not send) the upstream PR at `verification/UPSTREAM-PR-
   WORK-COUNTERS-0642.md`, matching this repo's contained-PR convention —
   this phase's diff should be small enough (see the Tier-1 estimate this
   ticket refines, ~40-150 LOC once done durably rather than in-memory) to
